  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Understandably, the new horizon adjust feature is meant to only accomodate for resting positions, but some of us in the beta are using horizon adjust to render FBT avatars upside down.\nWhen in upside down mode, left/right movement sticks are inverted, and the main menu renders upside down.\nI recommend the main menu to follow the viewpoint by also rotating sideways or upside down.",
